    ],
    "text": "Appointing a special steering committee as per the Railway Daily-Paid Workers\u2019 Benevolent Association Act bearing the number 03 of 1965",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.01,
      466.54,
      543.03,
      516.01
    ],
    "text": "IN terms of the power, vested upon the Secretary to the Ministry of Transport, Highways Ports and Civil Aviation pursuant to the clause 30 A (I) Ceylon Railway Workers\u2019 Benevolent Association Act, the Extraordinary Gazette bearing number 2373/37 and issued on 29.02.2024 will be cancelled on the approval, given through the letter bearing his number MT/03/05/21/17-1-1 and dated 06.03.2025.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.01,
      526.54,
      543.05,
      552.01
    ],
    "text": "Further, a special Steering Committee consisting with the below cited members will be appointed pursuant to the provisions of the Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
